 "remarks": "Investment or Owner-Occupied Mixed-Use Opportunity in Prime East Norwalk Exceptional turn-key mixed-use property situated along highly visible State Route 136 in the heart of East Norwalk. Delivered completely vacant, this 3-unit building presents an ideal setup for an owner-user or an investor seeking maximum rental upside and flexibility. Property Breakdown: First Floor (Front): Prime retail unit featuring a fully setup hair salon space with strong street visibility and direct access along Route 136. First Floor (Rear): Private 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom residential apartment, offering quiet living situated behind the retail shop. Second Floor & Attic: Spacious 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom residential unit featuring internal stair access to a full attic, providing excellent potential for bonus space, storage, or future expansion. Location & Highlights: Strategic placement in East Norwalk with high daily traffic counts and continuous exposure along Route 136. Immediate upside potential-lease all three units at prevailing market rates or occupy the commercial space while generating steady residential income. Convenient access to local transit, I-95, Metro-North, dining, and coastal Norwalk amenities.",
